{
  "file" : "npc/merchants/clothes_dyer.txt",
  "scripts" : [
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 31,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "11... 12... Mmm... good. I think I'll be able to finish before tonight's party. Oh! I didn't notice you were here!",
      "translation" : "1、2...嗯...不錯。我想今晚的派對前能做完。啊！我沒注意到你在這裡！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 35,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "How may I assist you?",
      "translation" : "有什麼可以幫你？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 37,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "- Talk",
      "translation" : "- 聊聊"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 37,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "- Dye Clothing",
      "translation" : "- 染色衣服"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 37,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "- Price List",
      "translation" : "- 價格表"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 37,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "- ^777777Cancel^000000",
      "translation" : "- ^777777取消^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 40,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Life may have gotten a bit better, but when I look at all of the orders I've received... Whew!",
      "translation" : "生活也許比以前好了一些，不過看看我接到的這些訂單...呼！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It seems that the young women of Rune-Midgarts must be very well off these days.",
      "translation" : "如今盧恩米德加爾特的年輕女性看來都很富裕。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 44,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Not that I think that they are indulging in anything luxurious, mind you.",
      "translation" : "當然，我不是說她們在追求奢侈生活。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 45,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I don't think there is anything wrong with the pursuit of beauty and being fashionable.",
      "translation" : "我認為追求美麗和時尚並沒有錯。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "For us humans, who have no colorful fur or decorative scales, clothes are one of the few ways we have to display our personality, style, and beauty.",
      "translation" : "我們人類沒有色彩斑斕的毛皮，也沒有裝飾性的鱗片，衣服是少數能展現個性、風格與美麗的方式之一。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 51,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Haha... When I think about it, I really feel that my job is worthwhile.  I believe that I provide a service that the people desire.",
      "translation" : "哈哈...想想看，我真的覺得自己的工作很有價值。我相信我提供的是大家需要的服務。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 54,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Can you feel it too? The energy that is released when rough fabric and leather are brought to life with color?.....",
      "translation" : "你也能感受到嗎？粗糙的布料和皮革被色彩賦予生命時釋放出的能量？..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 57,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Although the process is very tedious and time consuming, the joy and happiness I feel when a dress is finished more than makes up for all of the hard work!!",
      "translation" : "雖然過程非常繁瑣，也很耗時間，但完成一件禮服時的喜悅和幸福，足以彌補所有辛勞！！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Sorry, I'm too busy with other jobs to dye your clothes.",
      "translation" : "抱歉，我正忙著其他工作，沒法幫你染衣服。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh... you need my work? Well... okay, sounds good.",
      "translation" : "哦...你需要我幫忙？嗯...好吧，聽起來不錯。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Please choose a color",
      "translation" : "請選擇一種顏色"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 69,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "that suits you.",
      "translation" : "適合你的顏色。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 111,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Wow, I've never seen clothes like that before! I'm sorry, but I don't think I can paint it.",
      "translation" : "哇，我從沒見過這樣的衣服！抱歉，我想我沒辦法為它染色。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 116,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Each color costs 10000z and 1 dye:",
      "translation" : "每種顏色需要10000 Zeny和1份染料："
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 118,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : " - ^FF4422Red^000000: Scarlet Dyestuffs",
      "translation" : " - ^FF4422紅色^000000：猩紅染料"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 119,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : " - ^D5A500Yellow^000000: Lemon Dyestuffs",
      "translation" : " - ^D5A500黃色^000000：檸檬染料"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : " - ^AA00AAViolet^000000: Violet Dyestuffs",
      "translation" : " - ^AA00AA紫色^000000：紫色染料"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 121,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : " - ^FF8800Orange^000000: Orange Dyestuffs",
      "translation" : " - ^FF8800橙色^000000：橙色染料"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 122,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : " - ^4422FFBlue^000000: CobaltBlue Dyestuffs",
      "translation" : " - ^4422FF藍色^000000：鈷藍染料"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 123,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : " - ^009500Green^000000: DarkGreen Dyestuffs",
      "translation" : " - ^009500綠色^000000：深綠染料"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 124,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : " - Black: Black Dyestuffs",
      "translation" : " - 黑色：黑色染料"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 125,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : " - White: White Dyestuffs",
      "translation" : " - 白色：白色染料"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 134,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Make yourself at home. Even though I don't have time for you.",
      "translation" : "請隨意。不過我可沒空招待你。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 148,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I can change your dye to",
      "translation" : "我可以把染料改回"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 149,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "the default for free.",
      "translation" : "預設顏色，而且免費。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 150,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Are you sure?",
      "translation" : "你確定嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 152,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Yes",
      "translation" : "是"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 152,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "No",
      "translation" : "否"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 156,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "placeholders" : [
        ".@DyeName$[0]"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Your clothes have been dyed {0}.",
      "translation" : "你的衣服已經染成{0}。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 163,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "For me to dye your clothes, I'll need the appropriate Dyestuffs. Please check my price list for the information.",
      "translation" : "我要用對應的染料才能為你的衣服染色。詳情請檢視價格表。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 167,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'm sorry, but you don't have enough money.",
      "translation" : "抱歉，你的錢不夠。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 173,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "placeholders" : [
        "((.@s)?.@DyeName$[getarg((.@s-1)*2)]:.@DyeName$[0])"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Your clothes have been dyed {0}.",
      "translation" : "你的衣服已經染成{0}。"
    }
  ]
